    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Vladimir Rus brought Croatian, Slovenian, Italian, and Cleveland experiences into a life of language, political science, and education. Born in Rijeka, Croatia, he studied across Europe and the United States, earned advanced degrees and teaching credentials, and used that international background to teach, translate, and connect communities through Slavic languages and civic culture."
    ]
